{"id":"n65867-2-10","stage":2,"title":"뿌리다 · 撒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65867-2-10-1","ko":"무슨 약인데 아까부터 그렇게 뿌려?","zh":"这是什么药啊？从刚才开始就一直在喷这个？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"약인데","meaning":"用于杀灭害虫或动植物的物质。","explanation":"약：用于杀灭害虫或动植物的物质。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"2","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약인데","audio":"/audio/b0b3eee9ef8e4be1875b.mp3"}},{"text":"아까부터","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까부터","audio":"/audio/ce21fb59ded82e3bd3d0.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"뿌려?","meaning":"撒，散发","explanation":"뿌리다：撒，散发；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뿌리다","audio":"/audio/9486f088d39eab79fc2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65867","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뿌려","audio":"/audio/ef52f9f0fe825ef95972.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definitio